  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marib Humanitarian Programme Response - Programme Based Approach (PBA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is women, girls, men, boys, and their communities, effected by conflict, disease and climate disasters can meet their basic needs in Marib are driven by multiple and competing crises including armed conflict, structural violence, COVID -19 and other disease outbreaks, as well as vulnerability to natural hazards. The situation is aggravated by chronic poverty, entrenched displacement, food insecurity, and underlying inequalities including ethnic/tribe/caste discrimination, and gender disparities that exacerbate the needs, vulnerabilities, and marginalization of people in many parts of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
